Hi <%= @user.name %>,

Someone signed in to HardPoint with your email address and password, then typed <%= User::TwoFactor::ATTEMPTS_ALLOWED %> wrong two-factor codes. To keep your account safe, two-factor codes won't be accepted for the next <%= @minutes %> minutes.

If that was you, wait <%= @minutes %> minutes and use the newest code from your authenticator app, or a recovery code.

If it wasn't you, someone knows your password. Change it straight away with "Forgot password?" on your shop's sign-in page, and tell the shop's owner.
